[{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is diagonal and is defined such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By finding the eigenvectors of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>By finding <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>For <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(4-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)-2=\\lambda^2-7\\lambda+10=(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda-5).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=2:\\quad \\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad 2x+y=0,\\quad y=-2x,\\quad \\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=5:\\quad \\mathbf A-5\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad -x+y=0,\\quad y=x,\\quad \\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}6&amp;0\\\\0&amp;15\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>For each of the following, find a possible matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and a possible diagonal matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;2\\\\3&amp;6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}20&amp;12\\\\15&amp;17\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}12&amp;7\\\\-14&amp;-9\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(7-\\lambda)(6-\\lambda)-6=\\lambda^2-13\\lambda+36=(\\lambda-4)(\\lambda-9).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda=4\\text{ or }\\lambda=9.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-4\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\3&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3x+2y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-9\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;2\\\\3&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\3&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P=\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\3&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;2\\\\3&amp;6\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}20&amp;0\\\\0&amp;45\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;9\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;9\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(20-\\lambda)(17-\\lambda)-180=\\lambda^2-37\\lambda+160=(\\lambda-5)(\\lambda-32).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda=5\\text{ or }\\lambda=32.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-5\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}15&amp;12\\\\15&amp;12\\end{pmatrix},\\quad 15x+12y=0,\\quad 5x=-4y,\\quad \\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-32\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-12&amp;12\\\\15&amp;-15\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\-5&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac19\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\5&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P=\\frac19\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\5&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}20&amp;12\\\\15&amp;17\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\-5&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac19\\begin{pmatrix}45&amp;0\\\\0&amp;288\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;32\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1\\\\-5&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;32\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(12-\\lambda)(-9-\\lambda)+98=\\lambda^2-3\\lambda-10=(\\lambda+2)(\\lambda-5).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda=-2\\text{ or }\\lambda=5.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+2\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}14&amp;7\\\\-14&amp;-7\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-5\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;7\\\\-14&amp;-14\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}12&amp;7\\\\-14&amp;-9\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;1\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors of the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Explain why this matrix cannot be diagonalised.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(5-\\lambda)^2,\\quad \\lambda=5\\text{ or }\\lambda=5.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-5\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>A matrix is only diagonalisable if it has enough linearly independent eigenvectors and in this case there is only one independent eigenvector.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Aaron is finding eigenvalues and eigenvectors to diagonalise the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}13&amp;6\\\\3&amp;10\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. His workings are shown below:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda=7,\\;\\lambda=16,\\;\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-30&amp;9\\\\18&amp;-39\\end{pmatrix}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the two errors in his working.</p></li><li><p>Fully correct his working.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>He incorrectly constructs matrices <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; he should have used</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\begin{pmatrix}16&amp;0\\\\0&amp;7\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When computing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> he did not divide by the determinant.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-2\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-2\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}39&amp;18\\\\9&amp;30\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}13&amp;6\\\\3&amp;10\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Find each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}^{8}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}^{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}^{k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}^{8}=\\begin{pmatrix}5^8&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4^8\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}390625&amp;0\\\\0&amp;65536\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}^{10}=\\begin{pmatrix}1^{10}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(-2)^{10}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1024\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}^{k}=\\begin{pmatrix}a^k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Show that if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=(\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1})^n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1})(\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1})(\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1})\\cdots(\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D(\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf P)\\mathbf D(\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf P)\\mathbf D\\cdots(\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf P)\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf D\\mathbf D\\cdots\\mathbf D\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\\quad\\text{as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors of the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find possible matrices <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(3-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda),\\quad \\lambda=2\\text{ or }\\lambda=3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> can take any value, giving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=2,\\;\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\lambda_2=3,\\;\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\\Rightarrow\\mathbf P\\mathbf D=\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\\Rightarrow\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\mathbf A\\therefore\\mathbf A^4=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^4\\mathbf P^{-1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^4=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}^{4}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}16&amp;0\\\\0&amp;81\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}81&amp;65\\\\0&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&amp;0\\\\-15&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the corresponding eigenvectors for your eigenvalues.</p></li><li><p>Find possible matrices <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P=\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{50}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving each element in terms of suitable powers of 2.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(-4-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda),\\quad \\lambda=-4\\text{ or }\\lambda=1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+4\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\-15&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-5&amp;0\\\\-15&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> can take any value, giving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\\Rightarrow\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\mathbf A\\therefore\\mathbf A^4=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^4\\mathbf P^{-1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{50}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^{50}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^{100}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{100}&amp;0\\\\3\\times2^{100}-3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\frac14\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with corresponding eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> by using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a diagonal matrix and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the matrix of eigenvectors.</p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\\to\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac14\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1-4^{-n}\\\\0&amp;2\\times4^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(1-4^{-n})\\\\0&amp;4^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(1-4^{-n})\\\\0&amp;4^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;2\\\\1&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> by using <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a diagonal matrix and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the matrix of eigenvectors.</p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\\to\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=\\left(\\frac23-\\lambda\\right)\\left(\\frac56-\\lambda\\right)-\\frac1{18}=\\lambda^2-\\frac32\\lambda+\\frac12=\\frac12(2\\lambda-1)(\\lambda-1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=\\frac12,\\quad\\lambda_2=1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\frac12\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac16&amp;\\frac13\\\\\\frac16&amp;\\frac13\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac13&amp;\\frac13\\\\\\frac16&amp;-\\frac16\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^{-n}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}2^{1-n}+1&amp;1-2^{1-n}\\\\1-2^{-n}&amp;2+2^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}2^{1-n}+1&amp;1-2^{1-n}\\\\1-2^{-n}&amp;2+2^{-n}\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;3\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is diagonal and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the matrix of eigenvectors, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}4^n&amp;\\frac32(4^n-2^n)\\\\0&amp;2^n\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^n =\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-2^n\\\\2\\times4^n&amp;3\\times4^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}2\\times4^n&amp;3\\times4^n-3\\times2^n\\\\0&amp;2\\times2^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}4^n&amp;\\frac32(4^n-2^n)\\\\0&amp;2^n\\end{pmatrix}\\quad\\text{as req.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;6\\\\1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is diagonal and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the matrix of eigenvectors, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^n=5^{n-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;6\\\\1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(2-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)-6=\\lambda^2-5\\lambda=\\lambda(\\lambda-5).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=0,\\quad\\lambda_2=5.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\\mathbf v=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x+3y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-5\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;6\\\\1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=-\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^n =\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\-5^n&amp;-3\\times5^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}2\\times5^n&amp;6\\times5^n\\\\5^n&amp;3\\times5^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =5^{n-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;6\\\\1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\quad\\text{as req.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q\\\\p&amp;q\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\ne-q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^n=(p+q)^{n-1}\\mathbf A.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(p-\\lambda)(q-\\lambda)-pq=\\lambda^2-\\lambda(p+q)=\\lambda(\\lambda-(p+q)).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda=0\\text{ or }\\lambda=p+q.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+0\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q\\\\p&amp;q\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\\Rightarrow px+qy=0,\\quad qy=-px,\\quad\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}q\\\\-p\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=p+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-(p+q)\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-q&amp;q\\\\p&amp;-p\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}q&amp;1\\\\-p&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;p+q\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac1{p-q}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\p&amp;q\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac1{p+q}\\begin{pmatrix}q&amp;1\\\\-p&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(p+q)^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1\\\\p&amp;q\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac1{p+q}\\begin{pmatrix}p(p+q)^n&amp;q(p+q)^n\\\\p(p+q)^n&amp;q(p+q)^n\\end{pmatrix}=(p+q)^{n-1}\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q\\\\p&amp;q\\end{pmatrix}=(p+q)^{n-1}\\mathbf A\\quad\\text{as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.69-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\k-1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ne\\pm1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^{2n+1}=k^{2n}\\mathbf A.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(1-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda)-(k+1)(k-1)=\\lambda^2-k^2=(\\lambda+k)(\\lambda-k).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda=-k\\text{ or }\\lambda=k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+k\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1+k&amp;k+1\\\\k-1&amp;-1+k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-k\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1-k&amp;k+1\\\\k-1&amp;-1-k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{k-1}{k+1}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}k+1\\\\k-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\-1&amp;k-1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}-k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac1{2k}\\begin{pmatrix}k-1&amp;-(k+1)\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{2n+1}=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^{2n+1}\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac1{2k}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\-1&amp;k-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-k^{2n+1}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k^{2n+1}\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}k-1&amp;-(k+1)\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12k^{2n}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\-1&amp;k-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-k+1&amp;k+1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=k^{2n}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\k-1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=k^{2n}\\mathbf A^n\\quad\\text{as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]